<Layout title="The edit — Turn it up" description="Live music, vintage market finds, and a little music-inspired chaos. Images shared by Afterglow Vintage on Instagram set the mood." current="lookbook/">
  <section class="page-intro section"><p class="eyebrow">VOL. 02 / THE AFTERGLOW FIELD GUIDE</p><h1>FIND IT.<br /><em>TURN IT UP.</em></h1><p class="lead">Good clothes. Live sound. A few things worth stopping for, straight from the Afterglow Instagram.</p></section>
  <section id="off-duty" class="lookbook-story section"><div class="lookbook-image lookbook-image--market"><img src={url('images/zine/afterglow-market-live.jpg')} width="640" height="427" alt="A band playing beside clothing racks and colorful tents at an outdoor vintage market" fetchpriority="high" /><span class="lookbook-number">01</span></div><div class="lookbook-copy" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">LIVE FROM THE MARKET / SIDE A</p><h2>GOOD FINDS.<br /><em>LOUD SOUND.</em></h2><p>A drum kit between the clothing racks. Guitars beside the tents. Come for the digging; stay for whatever’s playing.</p><p class="styling-note">THE FORMULA / A FAVORITE TEE + SOMETHING SECONDHAND + LIVE MUSIC</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/afterglowvintageindy/p/DeXkN_xkion/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FROM @AFTERGLOWVINTAGEINDY ↗</a></div></section>
  <section id="in-the-details" class="lookbook-story section alternate"><div class="lookbook-image lookbook-image--music"><img src={url('images/zine/afterglow-live-performance.jpg')} width="1365" height="914" alt="A vocalist in sunglasses at a microphone, with a bassist performing behind, at the Afterglow Vintage Market" loading="lazy" /><span class="lookbook-number">02</span></div><div class="lookbook-copy" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">THE VOLUME KNOB / SIDE B</p><h2>WEAR IT<br /><em>LOUD.</em></h2><p>Live music, well-worn tees, and a whole lot of character. A closer look at the sound of Afterglow’s first vintage market.</p><p class="styling-note">THE FORMULA / A BAND TEE + WORN-IN DENIM + YOUR OWN VOLUME</p><p class="photo-credit">Photography: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/pipergrace_photography/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@pipergrace_photography ↗</a></p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/afterglowvintageindy/p/DeXkN_xkion/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FROM @AFTERGLOWVINTAGEINDY ↗</a></div></section>
  <section class="section closing-note"><p>These images come from Afterglow’s Instagram and set the mood; they aren't product listings.<br />For what’s available right now, head to the shop.</p><a class="button" href={url('shop/')}>Find your version ↗</a></section>
